2026-11-03T05:15:34.922398+00:00 hb-c10-sjukdom tts: PID 171903 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0197-s002", "text": "Om du omfattas av den finländska sjukförsäkringen (sairausvakuutus) har du efter en självrisktid (omavastuuaika) rätt att söka sjukdagpenning (sairauspäiväraha) hos F P A (Kela).", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-sjukdom/narration/hb-c10-u0197-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 16.788027210884355, "peak": 0.33941650390625, "generation_seconds": 66.07700320286676, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T05:16:04.924404+00:00 hb-c10-sjukdom tts: PID 171903 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0198-s001", "text": "Självrisktiden är vanligen den dag då du insjuknade och därpå följande nio vardagar.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-sjukdom/narration/hb-c10-u0198-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.592925170068027, "peak": 0.26751708984375, "generation_seconds": 29.510779852047563, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T05:16:38.508349+00:00 hb-c10-sjukdom tts: PID 171903 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0198-s002", "text": "Om din anställning har varat över en månad före insjuknandet betalar din arbetsgivare full lön för självrisktiden.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-sjukdom/narration/hb-c10-u0198-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.24, "peak": 0.258544921875, "generation_seconds": 42.73577259085141, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T05:17:12.092567+00:00 hb-c10-sjukdom tts: PID 171903 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0198-s003", "text": "Sjukdagpenning betalas för högst 300 vardagar.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-sjukdom/narration/hb-c10-u0198-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.154829931972789, "peak": 0.31591796875, "generation_seconds": 24.258373523131013, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T05:17:45.724545+00:00 hb-c10-sjukdom tts: PID 171903 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0198-s004", "text": "Den ska sökas inom två månader efter insjuknandet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-sjukdom/narration/hb-c10-u0198-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.597551020408163, "peak": 0.26959228515625, "generation_seconds": 25.152656381949782, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0199-s001", "text": "Du kan ansöka om sjukdagpenning om du:", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-sjukdom/narration/hb-c10-u0199-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.900952380952381, "peak": 0.3092041015625, "generation_seconds": 16.447736942907795, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
