{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0200-s001", "text": "omfattas av den finländska sjukförsäkringen", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-sjukdom/narration/hb-c10-u0200-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.597551020408163, "peak": 0.28326416015625, "generation_seconds": 20.021059456979856, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T05:18:52.881903+00:00 hb-c10-sjukdom tts: PID 171903 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0202-s001", "text": "är 18–67 år gammal", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-sjukdom/narration/hb-c10-u0202-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.7616326530612243, "peak": 0.334625244140625, "generation_seconds": 16.75244266912341, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0203-s001", "text": "är arbetsoförmögen på grund av en sjukdom", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-sjukdom/narration/hb-c10-u0203-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.388571428571429, "peak": 0.506072998046875, "generation_seconds": 17.86391131184064, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
